  "description": "Estella Ignacio has blossomed into a beautiful and alluring young woman, something all too apparent to Matias Monsetrat, the man Estella has been secretly in love with since they were young. But before they can even tell each other their true feelings, their bodies become more honest than their minds. As they both give in to their carnal desires, they are plagued with doubts and insecurities about losing each other. Will their love end in a nightmare or a dream come true?\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Part of Metatoon's Geumdan Danpyeonseon (금단(禁斷) 단편선) Collection.*",
